===Italy vs United States===
Italy midfielder [[Daniele De Rossi]] was sent off in the 28th minute after elbowing U.S. striker [[Brian McBride]] in a rash challenge that left the American with blood all over his face and requiring three stitches under his left eye. FIFA banned De Rossi for four matches (allowing him to return in the final) and fined him 10,000 [[Swiss franc|CHF]] (£4,500).<ref>{{cite web|title=De Rossi slapped with four-match ban|url=https://www.theguardian.com/football/2006/jun/23/worldcup2006.sport24|website=TheGuardian.com|publisher=Guardian News and Media Limited|accessdate=7 August 2014|date=23 June 2006}}</ref>
